WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.410
Give thanks!

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.420
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.830
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:25.000
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:47.790 --> 00:01:50.150
Someone once said:

00:01:50.490 --> 00:01:57.530
There is a willow tree from which 
grows the finest soba in the world,

00:01:57.530 --> 00:02:01.270
smooth as silk with just the 
right amount of bite to it,

00:02:01.270 --> 00:02:04.140
giving off an aroma that cannot be topped...

00:02:04.900 --> 00:02:08.370
The Sobawillow! {can't think of anything here...}

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:20.280
There are endless sweeping plains of tofu,

00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:24.260
dripping and moist, deep, 
rich, and flavorful,

00:02:24.260 --> 00:02:26.220
gently melting in your mouth,

00:02:26.220 --> 00:02:32.330
sliding smoothly down your 
throat with a supreme taste...

00:02:32.330 --> 00:02:35.830
The Tofu Plains!

00:02:37.270 --> 00:02:40.000
The world is in the Gourmet Age!

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:44.680
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:52.020
In order to capture the Regal Mammoth,

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:53.920
which holds inside it the 
treasured Jewel Meat,

00:02:53.920 --> 00:02:56.990
Toriko and Komatsu headed to Biotope #1.

00:02:58.160 --> 00:03:01.990
There, Toriko and Komatsu heard from 
Chief Mansom that the shadowy group,

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:04.930
the Gourmet Corp., had been making its move.

00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:11.240
On the other hand, at the main 
event in the Gourmet Coliseum,

00:03:11.240 --> 00:03:14.770
the legendary King of Beasts, 
Battle Wolf, appeared!

00:03:19.810 --> 00:03:23.880
And, incredibly, Toriko breaks inside!

00:03:26.620 --> 00:03:31.120
The Threat Appears! Rumble 
at the Gourmet Coliseum!

00:03:43.270 --> 00:03:47.010
Hey, Battle Wolf! You majestic legend!

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:54.280
It's really Toriko!

00:03:54.280 --> 00:03:55.950
The real Toriko is here?

00:03:55.950 --> 00:03:58.880
Toriko?! We can see Toriko fight?

00:03:58.880 --> 00:03:59.880
Toriko!

00:03:59.880 --> 00:04:00.850
It's Toriko!

00:04:00.850 --> 00:04:01.920
It's really him!

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:03.550
A real Toriko battle!

00:04:03.550 --> 00:04:05.060
Toriko-san!

00:04:05.060 --> 00:04:07.730
Where the heck did that idiot get in?

00:04:08.730 --> 00:04:15.000
What?! Through 2.5 meter thick 
specially strengthened acrylic?!

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:16.870
Toriko, Toriko, Toriko!

00:04:16.870 --> 00:04:18.740
Why is he inside the Coliseum?

00:04:18.740 --> 00:04:22.040
Filming something like this 
is one giant delicious scoop!

00:04:26.180 --> 00:04:27.380
Tina-san?

00:04:27.680 --> 00:04:29.280
Why is she here?

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:30.950
Tina-san...

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:33.020
Tina-san!

00:04:33.480 --> 00:04:36.020
What is it? Don't get in my way...

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:37.990
Komatsu-kun!

00:04:41.860 --> 00:04:43.730
She a friend of yours?

00:04:43.730 --> 00:04:45.330
Y-Yeah...

00:04:48.930 --> 00:04:52.640
I stopped you with a Two-Fold, but 
I guess that wasn't enough power.

00:04:55.240 --> 00:04:57.310
You're being a pest!

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:14.060
She doesn't look like she wants to fight...

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:16.890
She didn't react to my intimidation, either.

00:05:17.830 --> 00:05:20.300
Which means it's just as I thought.

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:35.050
These are on the house.

00:05:36.880 --> 00:05:38.720
That's Pear Bread!

00:05:38.720 --> 00:05:41.520
They're super fancy, like 
700,000 yen a piece!

00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:45.490
When the battle heats up, we 
treat everyone to a full spread!

00:05:50.360 --> 00:05:52.130
A mountain of delicious!

00:05:52.130 --> 00:05:55.700
Soft, and juicy... They 
like, melt in my mouth!

00:05:55.700 --> 00:05:57.400
But they have this firmness, too...

00:05:57.400 --> 00:05:59.370
And above all, this aroma...!

00:05:59.940 --> 00:06:02.040
Sweet, and melancholic...

00:06:02.740 --> 00:06:06.880
The special beastly smell that wolves 
have is mixed up with some pheromone...

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:12.520
There's no doubt... She's pregnant!

00:06:12.750 --> 00:06:14.720
And she's right about to give birth!

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:18.490
But wait... A single clone got pregnant?

00:06:18.490 --> 00:06:20.690
Then, could this be parthenogenesis?

00:06:20.990 --> 00:06:22.960
Is something like that even possible?

00:06:27.500 --> 00:06:28.700
Battle Wolf!

00:06:30.770 --> 00:06:33.240
Hey... What's going on here?

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:38.240
Chief! Call off the match!

00:06:38.240 --> 00:06:40.280
The Battle Wolf cannot fight!

00:06:40.610 --> 00:06:43.950
Tell Rin to stop the 
Battle Fragrance at once!

00:06:43.950 --> 00:06:45.250
Understood.

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:47.950
Toriko-san, behind you!

00:06:55.060 --> 00:06:58.330
Sorry, but take a little nap!

00:07:11.510 --> 00:07:14.880
Rin, Rin! Stop the BF!

00:07:14.880 --> 00:07:18.280
Not happening! I can't fix this one bit!

00:07:18.280 --> 00:07:19.980
Do something!

00:07:19.980 --> 00:07:21.450
Stop pushing me, Baldy!

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:23.960
You just called me handsome, yes?

00:07:24.520 --> 00:07:26.290
No, I didn't.

00:07:26.290 --> 00:07:30.400
Anyway, it'll be faster for me to 
go there and use a Fragrance myself.

00:07:30.400 --> 00:07:32.830
You definitely called me handsome, yes?

00:07:33.400 --> 00:07:35.000
I told you, I didn't!

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:36.330
Well, get over here on the double!

00:07:36.330 --> 00:07:38.000
I got ya...

00:07:38.400 --> 00:07:39.970
You just said handsome, right?!

00:07:39.970 --> 00:07:43.710
I didn't even say anything close to that!

00:07:53.890 --> 00:07:56.020
There's even more coming out now!

00:07:56.020 --> 00:07:57.590
What's going on?

00:07:57.590 --> 00:07:59.320
Oh, crap!

00:07:59.320 --> 00:08:02.560
It's even more broke than before!

00:08:16.470 --> 00:08:18.580
Gate No. 6 is in trouble!

00:08:26.620 --> 00:08:28.490
Guess I have no choice...

00:08:28.720 --> 00:08:32.960
Battle Wolves were supposed to have 
gone extinct far in the past...

00:08:33.830 --> 00:08:38.300
Is this kid of yours some prank from 
the tiny bit of DNA we recovered?

00:08:38.300 --> 00:08:41.800
Or is it a present from your ancestors?

00:08:42.130 --> 00:08:44.240
Either way, it's a blessing.

00:08:44.840 --> 00:08:47.040
You just relax and give birth.

00:08:47.540 --> 00:08:49.640
Leave them to me.

00:08:49.910 --> 00:08:53.610
It must be humiliating to 
become a sideshow for humans

00:08:53.610 --> 00:08:55.150
to a prideful creature like you.

00:08:55.950 --> 00:08:57.750
I'll do something about that.

00:08:58.750 --> 00:09:01.120
And give you a little fireworks 
to celebrate, as well!

00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:04.120
Sorry about this...

00:09:04.890 --> 00:09:07.660
You'll be helping me out a bit!

00:09:20.340 --> 00:09:23.840
Don't fret! That's specially 
strengthened acrylic.

00:09:23.840 --> 00:09:25.610
Even a rocket launcher wouldn't...

00:09:31.520 --> 00:09:33.020
Sorry, Chief!

00:09:33.020 --> 00:09:35.220
Shut down the Coliseum for a bit!

00:09:35.450 --> 00:09:37.690
D-Don't! Stop it!

00:09:41.060 --> 00:09:44.200
Five-Fold Spiked Punch!

00:10:01.410 --> 00:10:03.580
We're in trouble if the beasts come out!

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:04.620
Run for it!

00:10:05.450 --> 00:10:07.020
Toriko-san...

00:10:07.020 --> 00:10:08.290
What is he doing?

00:10:08.290 --> 00:10:10.250
That crazy son of a...

00:10:16.360 --> 00:10:17.730
Komatsu!

00:10:18.360 --> 00:10:21.500
Look, isn't it beautiful?

00:10:21.830 --> 00:10:23.900
Fireworks for this blessed occasion!

00:10:24.370 --> 00:10:27.470
To welcome the arrival of a new Battle Wolf!

00:10:27.470 --> 00:10:28.810
What?

00:10:35.310 --> 00:10:37.950
Welcome to the Gourmet Age!

00:10:48.590 --> 00:10:52.260
Oh, crap! This is seriously 
bad! His tension is maxed out!

00:10:57.870 --> 00:11:00.040
Super Relaxation!

00:11:02.040 --> 00:11:04.610
It's a fragrance that's concentrated 
tranquility pheromones

00:11:04.610 --> 00:11:09.680
from the most peace-loving creature 
in the world, the Grinning Manatee!

00:11:11.680 --> 00:11:15.490
It'll relax any creature 
that's enraged in an instant!

00:11:15.490 --> 00:11:17.720
Now calm down, damn you!

00:11:26.060 --> 00:11:28.130
Crap, crappity crap!

00:11:45.480 --> 00:11:48.650
Get back inside!

00:11:52.290 --> 00:11:54.890
Frying Pan Punch!

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:04.070
Sorry, but stay quiet there for a bit.

00:12:04.670 --> 00:12:08.710
However, it's astonishing that a clone 
would give birth without fertilization...

00:12:08.910 --> 00:12:11.180
Perhaps it's the work of Gourmet Cells?

00:12:11.180 --> 00:12:12.410
Gourmet Cells?

00:12:12.780 --> 00:12:16.650
And I can't believe Toriko 
could break this dome...

00:12:16.710 --> 00:12:20.180
He's clearly powered up 
since I knew him last...

00:12:20.180 --> 00:12:22.750
I guess this proves he's 
eaten some good grub...

00:12:24.990 --> 00:12:28.690
Battle Wolves are solitary creatures 
with not a gram of pack instinct.

00:12:29.130 --> 00:12:33.130
They only know parental love for 
the one day they are born...

00:12:33.130 --> 00:12:36.830
Getting a record of this miracle of 
the legendary King of Beasts is...

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:53.550
That young woman's got spunk.

00:12:57.690 --> 00:12:59.920
She exhausted herself.

00:12:59.920 --> 00:13:03.260
It's common for somatic cell clones 
to have shorter life-spans,

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:05.200
so perhaps that's why.

00:13:05.200 --> 00:13:08.330
At any rate, you rest up now.

00:13:09.630 --> 00:13:12.270
Seriously? Crap!

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:20.950
Demon Devil Python (Reptilian 
Beast) Capture Level 25

00:13:23.250 --> 00:13:24.480
Run for it!

00:13:24.480 --> 00:13:27.120
We got another amazing customer here!

00:13:27.120 --> 00:13:29.790
A Devil Python is trouble enough!

00:13:29.790 --> 00:13:31.260
But this guy's even worse!

00:13:45.840 --> 00:13:48.570
Hey, hey... You're a little too excited here!

00:13:54.850 --> 00:13:56.350
Knife!

00:14:05.060 --> 00:14:06.890
Damn that Rin...

00:14:07.830 --> 00:14:09.560
You're not running away?

00:14:11.730 --> 00:14:14.800
Well, it's usually like 
this with Toriko-san...

00:14:14.800 --> 00:14:16.570
I'm used to it by now.

00:14:16.570 --> 00:14:19.740
I'm used to it, but still scared, though.

00:14:22.240 --> 00:14:24.210
That's some guts you got!

00:14:24.910 --> 00:14:28.510
Like that woman, you're really something.

00:14:28.910 --> 00:14:32.020
All while the heads of all those 
countries are, as you can see...

00:14:32.680 --> 00:14:38.060
All those rich and powerful wimps 
are pitiful without weapons.

00:14:45.260 --> 00:14:46.630
That's...

00:14:50.570 --> 00:14:54.610
My, my... If it isn't Dohem, the 
President of the Republic of Roto!

00:14:58.480 --> 00:15:03.410
I do apologize that our splendid 
event has turned out this way.

00:15:03.410 --> 00:15:05.920
I understand this must be an 
incredible disappointment,

00:15:05.920 --> 00:15:07.590
but your safety is our first priority,

00:15:07.590 --> 00:15:09.490
so if you could please hurry and evacuate...

00:15:19.060 --> 00:15:20.500
Chief!

00:15:32.910 --> 00:15:35.180
Frying Pan Punch!

00:15:45.090 --> 00:15:48.130
Hey, hey... What the hell is that?

00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:50.400
Check Dohem's ID this instant!

00:15:50.400 --> 00:15:51.130
Yes, sir!

00:15:52.700 --> 00:15:56.700
Face verified. Retina. Iris. Fingerprints.

00:15:58.000 --> 00:16:00.610
Vein patterns... Everything checks out!

00:16:01.210 --> 00:16:03.140
Check his Gourmet ID.

00:16:03.140 --> 00:16:06.640
But one's Gourmet ID is top-secret 
personal information!

00:16:06.640 --> 00:16:07.750
Even the Bureau can't...

00:16:07.750 --> 00:16:09.250
This is an emergency situation!

00:16:09.250 --> 00:16:10.620
We should be able to get authorization.

00:16:10.620 --> 00:16:12.250
Ask for it and wait for a response!

00:16:15.020 --> 00:16:17.260
Laser cannons are ready to fire!

00:16:19.060 --> 00:16:21.530
The Chief is sending the "wait" signal...

00:16:21.860 --> 00:16:23.590
This is our chance!

00:16:37.680 --> 00:16:38.810
That's...

00:16:39.740 --> 00:16:41.810
No, it's a different one.

00:16:41.810 --> 00:16:43.610
No way... It's another one?

00:16:43.850 --> 00:16:47.350
Well, now that I look carefully, 
it's 10 grams different...

00:16:47.690 --> 00:16:49.650
The one before had black fur...

00:16:49.650 --> 00:16:51.890
No, that's not all.

00:16:51.890 --> 00:16:55.060
Something else is different...

00:16:56.290 --> 00:16:57.500
Toriko!

00:17:05.640 --> 00:17:07.470
The new model I've heard rumors about?

00:17:08.970 --> 00:17:14.150
Are you a genius or a fool 
for sneaking in here?

00:17:14.580 --> 00:17:20.280
You have my thanks for presenting 
me with this precious sample.

00:17:20.820 --> 00:17:22.550
Gourmet Corp.

00:17:25.060 --> 00:17:26.790
Who's the operator?

00:17:27.890 --> 00:17:30.060
You can hear and talk, yes?

00:17:30.060 --> 00:17:31.700
What's your goal?

00:17:31.700 --> 00:17:35.500
Chief, you look tasty...

00:17:36.000 --> 00:17:37.840
You're Bei!

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:42.540
Knocking!

00:17:43.610 --> 00:17:46.810
Sorry, but mine aren't there...

00:17:58.260 --> 00:18:00.990
Frying Pan Sandwich!

00:18:10.100 --> 00:18:11.440
You're a tough one.

00:18:43.330 --> 00:18:44.940
You can't with your body like that!

00:19:00.990 --> 00:19:02.520
She bit through it?

00:19:02.520 --> 00:19:06.790
I could hardly see it! 
What power! What speed!

00:19:26.910 --> 00:19:29.550
So that's a Battle Wolf?

00:19:29.550 --> 00:19:31.020
Amazing...

00:19:31.020 --> 00:19:32.150
Are you kidding me?

00:19:39.860 --> 00:19:41.130
Battle Wolf!

00:19:45.730 --> 00:19:49.570
She used up almost all her 
energy with that attack...

00:19:50.130 --> 00:19:53.400
It looks like she'll take 
a long time to recover.

00:19:57.080 --> 00:19:58.180
Go.

00:20:00.080 --> 00:20:05.180
Go nuzzle your mother who gave her whole 
life for birthing you into this world.

00:21:02.840 --> 00:21:05.940
I have no interest in eating a Battle Wolf.

00:21:06.280 --> 00:21:09.880
Looks gross! No need!

00:21:28.470 --> 00:21:34.140
Is the night wind, caressing my cheek

00:21:34.640 --> 00:21:40.380
proof the world is spinning, I wonder?

00:21:41.150 --> 00:21:47.620
Each time I move out, the 
direction of the wind changes.

00:21:48.020 --> 00:21:52.590
Maybe that’s telling me something.

00:21:53.860 --> 00:21:57.700
I was searching for what happiness meant.

00:21:57.700 --> 00:22:01.070
Aiming for the island in my dreams,

00:22:01.070 --> 00:22:05.540
on a journey with no end!

00:22:07.340 --> 00:22:10.510
Blown by the winds of tomorrow,

00:22:10.510 --> 00:22:13.610
drifting off to who-knows-where,

00:22:13.610 --> 00:22:19.650
amid the waves of time.

00:22:22.720 --> 00:22:24.590
Gourmet News!

00:22:25.290 --> 00:22:27.160
I'm your host, Tina.

00:22:27.160 --> 00:22:29.930
Lately there have been a lot of people

00:22:29.930 --> 00:22:32.600
who have totally forgotten 
to renew their Gourmet IDs.

00:22:32.600 --> 00:22:33.700
As you well know,

00:22:33.700 --> 00:22:35.670
your Gourmet ID holds the 
data on every ingredient

00:22:35.670 --> 00:22:36.900
you have eaten since your birth,

00:22:36.900 --> 00:22:40.640
as well as the amount, time, 
and number of times you chewed.

00:22:40.640 --> 00:22:43.210
It's an identification system that

00:22:43.210 --> 00:22:46.180
can differentiate even one's 
subconscious knowledge!

00:22:46.610 --> 00:22:50.550
If you don't renew and register your 
card, you can't prove your identity,

00:22:50.550 --> 00:22:53.520
So please renew it once every three years.

00:22:54.020 --> 00:22:57.420
Huh? Ack! Mine's expired!

00:23:01.760 --> 00:23:03.730
Now, on to the next story!

00:23:06.700 --> 00:23:08.270
Toriko is furious...

00:23:08.270 --> 00:23:11.070
At that anteater clown who attacked the Battle Wolf!

00:23:11.450 --> 00:23:13.600
Get him, Toriko!

00:23:13.920 --> 00:23:16.910
The Ones that are Passed Down! Activate, Gourmet Cells!

00:23:16.910 --> 00:23:19.310
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
